  "worked_solution": "The instantaneous rate of change of the funding is ${F}^{\u2032}(t).$\n\nWe take the derivative and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{F}^{\u2032}(t) & =\\frac{d}{dt}[5+(t+1)\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(t+1)] \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(t+1)+(t+1)\\cdot \\frac{1}{t+1} \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(t+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change of the funding is $1+\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(t+1)$ million dollars per year.",
